What the App is — and isn't
The App is a planning and calculation aid for footpath and ramp gradients ("falls"), landing spacing, and related design considerations, referenced against AS 1428.1:2021 — Design for access and mobility. It offers a Simple Mode slope calculator and a Path Builder tool for modelling multi-segment paths.

The App is not:

a substitute for assessment, design, or certification by a registered building surveyor, certifier, access consultant, or engineer;
a guarantee that any path, ramp, or footpath built using its outputs will be approved by a certifying authority or local council;
a reproduction of, or authoritative source for, the text of AS 1428.1 or any other Australian Standard.
